I\L\S\K\N Compressor disconnection codes.\L\B\K\I
00: not off
01: charge pressure (&gt;= 32 bar) 
02: fan faulty
03: pressure too low (&lt;= 2 bar) 
04: no indication
05: engine ignition recognised
06: ECON functioning (air conditioning not on)
